Package: heysocks-lan-proxy-client
Version: 1.3.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, libglib2.0-bin
Maintainer: Heysocks LAN Proxy Project <noreply@heysocks.local>
Description: Heysocks LAN HTTP/HTTPS proxy client for Ubuntu
 A small GTK client that tests a LAN proxy endpoint and safely captures,
 enables, and restores the current user's GNOME system proxy settings.
